@* ─── _AddressForm.cshtml ──────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
@* Reusable address block for both Sender (prefix="Sender") and            *@
@* Receiver (prefix="Receiver") wizard steps.                              *@
@*                                                                         *@
@* Usage:                                                                  *@
@*   <partial name="_AddressForm" model='new AddressFormViewModel {         *@
@*       Prefix      = "Sender",                                           *@
@*       NameLabel   = "Sender Name",                                      *@
@*       NameField   = Model.Sender.SenderName,                            *@
@*       ... etc                                                           *@
@*   }' />                                                                 *@
@*                                                                         *@
@* Because Razor partials cannot bind to parent model prefixes             *@
@* transparently, we keep the full field inputs inside each parent         *@
@* fieldset and only extract the SHARED STYLING into this partial.         *@
@* This partial is therefore used for SHARED CSS only, loaded once.        *@

@* ── Shared address-form styles injected once via Layout's Styles section *@
